{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/4ded818c0c119123713566f7930837b0.webp?t=1771240962\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/4ded818c0c119123713566f7930837b0.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=117 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alters</strong> is an ambitious <strong>sci-fi survival</strong> game with a unique twist. You play as <strong>Jan Dolski</strong>, the lone survivor of a crash-landed expedition on a hostile planet. To survive, you must form a new crew for your mobile base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a substance called Rapidium, you create alternative versions of Jan -\u00a0<strong>THE ALTERS</strong>\u00a0- each one shaped by a different crucial decision from the protagonist\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate through survival and moral dilemmas, you will explore a branching narrative filled with captivating character dynamics and challenging decisions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/a2f86341cf368803fab22695eb23db0a.avif?t=1771240962\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>At the same time, you\u2019re challenged to reflect on one of life\u2019s fundamental questions \u2013 do we shape our destiny or does it shape us? <strong>This makes your bid for survival a deeply personal experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/6e8dcc89bd1c83509acee75433547747.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the quantum computer onboard your base to simulate alternate outcomes of your past choices and uncover Jan\u2019s different life paths. Each Alter brought to life thanks to the remarkable properties of Rapidium comes with unique skills and emotional depths. These variations offer both opportunities and challenges as you navigate personal struggles and manage the fragile dynamics of your crew.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/1f3cd8d9b2f3a16ac15a5055b56b609e.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/1f3cd8d9b2f3a16ac15a5055b56b609e.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/73c0a3a2146e43e20b3e295aa4f7a2fd.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To operate the mobile base, you\u2019ll need to explore the planet\u2019s surface in search of precious resources, like metals and organics. Yet venturing outside the safe haven comes with the risk of exposing you and your Alters to various deadly anomalies as well as the ever-present radiation of the sun. That\u2019s why you must pay attention to the in-game day and night cycle and plan your daily activities wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/ac6391eb258571dd43273bed8d6124d1.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/9da640d23f6243760e3908e588c1e076.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a narrative rich with moral dilemmas and branching paths. Your choices will shape Jan\u2019s relations with his Alters which then will impact their journey and lead you to multiple outcomes and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f57ec1ff35ae922c1f45bc95378258d2.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f57ec1ff35ae922c1f45bc95378258d2.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/2c79d040c4b40da1a34fab99ca6490a9.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathered resources can be used in different ways \u2013 create necessary items or develop your base with additional modules like Research Lab or Social Room. Sometimes you will have to choose between creating items specially for your Alters and ones that could push the mission forward, like Anomaly Detectors or Radiation Filters. The burden of every decision lies solely on your shoulders as you will never be able to satisfy everyone\u2019s needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/99c4f62049b2e063ab2ddc6712585251.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/99c4f62049b2e063ab2ddc6712585251.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/0023468033ea44bed786a6430fed89eb.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet features unique biomes and secrets waiting to be found, but deadly anomalies stand in your way. Levitating rocks and eerie distortions of reality attract attention immediately, while other singularities remain invisible to the naked eye and require special tools to uncover. In all cases, you must be extra careful - or face the risk of instant death, radiation-induced injuries, and even disintegration of time and space. Also, you may want to avoid exploring the planet during hours when intense radioactivity can eat right through your suit. Happy travels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d2e9f5b9461b11852bc93c6b7379eef0.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d2e9f5b9461b11852bc93c6b7379eef0.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/c2d8f924c644c0655b74b4e3a3bdcee1.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jan Dolski is about to face the answers to the essential \u201cwhat if?\u201d question in the form of alternative versions of himself. This makes the predicament he is in even more daunting as you slowly discover the impact every choice has on Jan\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The Alters poses you with life\u2019s most nagging questions\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f8cf45b28539d3bd834550e0978c38a3.webp?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d39133c0562cbe69b2be7df34b6bd0ab.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d39133c0562cbe69b2be7df34b6bd0ab.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f21f516eb7c0ccb060819f0abb40877b.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=93 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The survivor ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/4787d3016e59fd8c271ce93565336e2cebff5f06.jpg"},{"name":"Two of us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/b3bf28989195bed03e2a5fa7571a8d07b51d17d3.jpg"},{"name":"Dig Deeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/c320a7178a2e183619f6f05f54027ad61e91e828.jpg"},{"name":"Let's roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/77597fc30db07cc05a25c06cf21b76db5ccbdb4f.jpg"},{"name":"The Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/05ba20c43acd3c3df857ba01c55ee9ed62ca92ae.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing's gonna stop us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/de67f870b1b9c663805c6a5e9dde820d7ee9bc71.jpg"},{"name":"Into the storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/3081ec748e3ff9506d571cabd2f4b784b7860810.jpg"},{"name":"Time to go home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/3c314e25b9fd2a093f4e788551afa8e66536a7ad.jpg"},{"name":"I Found You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/df405883e3605fe992c443313cdfc945eee4b5ce.jpg"},{"name":"Corporate Plug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601570/045d6543d86a951abab1cf6b38343abc36df56a9.jpg"}],"total":56},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1601570?t=1771240962","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771240962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/5934a27732c4867d605121201078eae8bd46ef4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771240962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/5934a27732c4867d605121201078eae8bd46ef4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771240962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages (e.g. realistic violence, blood, use of tobacco, consumption of alcohol, mention of illegal drugs, crude language)."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/7703a5d312bc574b6a38573427940ca3.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=739 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/e8a5a3f1451a3a1350802d1937c74168.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=631 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/4ded818c0c119123713566f7930837b0.webp?t=1771240962\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/4ded818c0c119123713566f7930837b0.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=117 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alters</strong> is an ambitious <strong>sci-fi survival</strong> game with a unique twist. You play as <strong>Jan Dolski</strong>, the lone survivor of a crash-landed expedition on a hostile planet. To survive, you must form a new crew for your mobile base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a substance called Rapidium, you create alternative versions of Jan -\u00a0<strong>THE ALTERS</strong>\u00a0- each one shaped by a different crucial decision from the protagonist\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/a74a1990d34b2ff2121ace03a57b5334.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate through survival and moral dilemmas, you will explore a branching narrative filled with captivating character dynamics and challenging decisions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/a2f86341cf368803fab22695eb23db0a.avif?t=1771240962\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>At the same time, you\u2019re challenged to reflect on one of life\u2019s fundamental questions \u2013 do we shape our destiny or does it shape us? <strong>This makes your bid for survival a deeply personal experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/6e8dcc89bd1c83509acee75433547747.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the quantum computer onboard your base to simulate alternate outcomes of your past choices and uncover Jan\u2019s different life paths. Each Alter brought to life thanks to the remarkable properties of Rapidium comes with unique skills and emotional depths. These variations offer both opportunities and challenges as you navigate personal struggles and manage the fragile dynamics of your crew.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/1f3cd8d9b2f3a16ac15a5055b56b609e.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/1f3cd8d9b2f3a16ac15a5055b56b609e.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/73c0a3a2146e43e20b3e295aa4f7a2fd.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To operate the mobile base, you\u2019ll need to explore the planet\u2019s surface in search of precious resources, like metals and organics. Yet venturing outside the safe haven comes with the risk of exposing you and your Alters to various deadly anomalies as well as the ever-present radiation of the sun. That\u2019s why you must pay attention to the in-game day and night cycle and plan your daily activities wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/ac6391eb258571dd43273bed8d6124d1.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/9da640d23f6243760e3908e588c1e076.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a narrative rich with moral dilemmas and branching paths. Your choices will shape Jan\u2019s relations with his Alters which then will impact their journey and lead you to multiple outcomes and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f57ec1ff35ae922c1f45bc95378258d2.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f57ec1ff35ae922c1f45bc95378258d2.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/2c79d040c4b40da1a34fab99ca6490a9.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathered resources can be used in different ways \u2013 create necessary items or develop your base with additional modules like Research Lab or Social Room. Sometimes you will have to choose between creating items specially for your Alters and ones that could push the mission forward, like Anomaly Detectors or Radiation Filters. The burden of every decision lies solely on your shoulders as you will never be able to satisfy everyone\u2019s needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/99c4f62049b2e063ab2ddc6712585251.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/99c4f62049b2e063ab2ddc6712585251.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/0023468033ea44bed786a6430fed89eb.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet features unique biomes and secrets waiting to be found, but deadly anomalies stand in your way. Levitating rocks and eerie distortions of reality attract attention immediately, while other singularities remain invisible to the naked eye and require special tools to uncover. In all cases, you must be extra careful - or face the risk of instant death, radiation-induced injuries, and even disintegration of time and space. Also, you may want to avoid exploring the planet during hours when intense radioactivity can eat right through your suit. Happy travels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d2e9f5b9461b11852bc93c6b7379eef0.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d2e9f5b9461b11852bc93c6b7379eef0.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/c2d8f924c644c0655b74b4e3a3bdcee1.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jan Dolski is about to face the answers to the essential \u201cwhat if?\u201d question in the form of alternative versions of himself. This makes the predicament he is in even more daunting as you slowly discover the impact every choice has on Jan\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The Alters poses you with life\u2019s most nagging questions\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f8cf45b28539d3bd834550e0978c38a3.webp?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d39133c0562cbe69b2be7df34b6bd0ab.poster.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/d39133c0562cbe69b2be7df34b6bd0ab.webm?t=1771240962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/extras/f21f516eb7c0ccb060819f0abb40877b.avif?t=1771240962\" width=616 height=93 /></span></p>","developers":["11 bit studios"],"dlc":[3237500],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601570/header.jpg?t=1771240962","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"11 BIT STUDIOS\u00ae, THE ALTERS\u00ae are registered trademarks of 11 BIT STUDIOS S.A.<br />\r\n\u00a9 11 BIT STUDIOS S.A. All other marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":85,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/the-alters?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601570/865108/f0c87a20c2af2ceb3f14204d155c893a5dd7ca43/1749846832/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744302487","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601570/865108/f0c87a20c2af2ceb3f14204d155c893a5dd7ca43/1749846832/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744302487","highl